  "verifiedArchiveSha256": "64a27b3b64138991235ab5ca8f07576d34c09ca90d5050dffc60ea1ed4ebdebf",
  "applicationChanges": [
    "Extracted and connected the selected core page renderer, title/body editor, toolbar, slash menu, table/code/link/file UI, virtualized tree, comments, revision history and editable diagram components. Per-file entries preserve original pinned source hashes and describe adaptations.",
    "Our authorized domain API and PostgreSQL remain canonical for notes, revisions, permissions, files, tree moves and collaboration records. Core components consume explicit pane props and existing bounded API adapters; no upstream server, authentication, public sharing, Enterprise code, query service, Hocuspocus, Yjs or browser body database is retained.",
    "Each pane owns its Jotai editor/title/history/menu context and in-memory tab drafts. Explicit note saves retain revision checks and idempotency; immutable attachment uploads do not silently commit note bodies. Access loss clears protected state and rejects late attachment updates.",
    "The tree requests one 50-row sibling page at a time and retains at most 24 pages. Comments/history/relations use bounded 20-row API pages and at most 100 visible records. Core virtualization, keyboard navigation and parent drag-and-drop operate on these bounded results.",
    "Draw.io preserves editable XML with explicitly approved embed origins, Excalidraw preserves scene elements/appState/embedded files locally, and Mermaid preserves source text with strict sanitized rendering. A pinned dependency patch removes both SDK font CDN fallbacks; production fonts ship with the client.",
    "The complete modified-client source offer includes provenance, build scripts, package pins, release lockfile, dependency patch and license/notice texts. Runtime-import and component tests support source reuse; authenticated PostgreSQL live acceptance and representative capacity measurements remain separate checks.",
    "Relocated the note-only client to the public fork root. Removed the upstream server, Enterprise modules, account/organization/workspace management and deployment stack. Replaced parent-repository Make entrypoints with client-only commands and retained the existing Node/pnpm pins.",
    "Connected the KN-02 context to authorized accumulation and comparison APIs, including source visibility and timing, actual applied rule versions, review/action links and bounded history pages. Scoped title, body and comment sizing for the note-only layout and added isolated browser regression tests against the real API.",
    "Made the approved Draw.io embed the single editable source while open, preserving direct XML editing without an embed. Disabled external service features, service-worker setup and plugins through upstream URL parameters. Real graphical save/reopen and live attachment revocation are covered by isolated real-API browser tests.",
    "Use the API's effective space role for note creation, selection, dragging and writable move destinations. Select Draw.io's graphical read-only viewer when the note cannot be edited. Actual account demotion and direct denied writes are verified against the real API."
  ],
